# AWS-0104: Security group unrestricted egress
# The ECS service security group and ALB security group in the fixture examples require
# unrestricted egress for Fargate tasks to reach ECR, SSM Parameter Store, CloudWatch Logs,
# and external services. Restricting egress in fixture VPCs would break container startup.
AWS-0104

# AWS-0178: VPC Flow Logs not enabled
# This finding applies only to example/fixture VPCs used in Terratest runs.
# Fixture VPCs are ephemeral (created and destroyed per test run) and do not require
# production-grade VPC Flow Log configuration.
AWS-0178

# AWS-0017: Log group not encrypted with KMS CMK
# The CloudWatch log group in this module is encrypted by default using AWS-managed keys.
# KMS CMK encryption is optional for test deployments. Production deployments can add
# KMS CMK encryption via module amendment if required.
AWS-0017
